SUMMARY:COMP0002: Haskell teaching starts this week
DESCRIPTION:The functional programming half runs 16 November–18 December.
  The first module slides confirm a 5% Haskell in-class test and a 90% Term
  3 exam. A classmate reports 14 December for the test\, but no written con
 firmation was found. Confirm the test date/time with Dr David Clark\; cons
 ult your personal timetable for lectures and your allocated lab.\n\nCertai
 nty: Published\nTimezone: Europe/London (GMT during this calendar).\nSnaps
 hot: 15 November 2026\; this file does not sync automatically.\nSources:\n
 https://moodle.ucl.ac.uk/course/section.php?id=1378607\nhttps://moodle.ucl
 .ac.uk/mod/resource/view.php?id=8508469
CATEGORIES:MILESTONE,COMP0002
URL:https://moodle.ucl.ac.uk/course/section.php?id=1378607
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
